      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3309\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/03/05/metal-corrugated-007/material_testing_028/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/material_testing_028.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_testing_028\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/material_testing_028.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3309\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/material_testing_028.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_testing_028\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3309\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/03/05/metal-corrugated-007/material_testing_028/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/material_testing_028.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_testing_028\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/material_testing_028.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3309 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_testing_028\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/material_testing_028.png\"></p>\n<h2>Metal Corrugated 007 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n<li>Metallic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS and a SBSAR files (<a href=\"http://3dtextures.me/what-are-sbs-sbsar-files/\">what are these?</a>) for texture customization.</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=13nUglp2wZfVcxH9asdxm4wff2XuHHS6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3138\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/28/fabric-011/button-download/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=1105%2C220&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1105,220\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"button-download\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=800%2C159&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3138\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?resize=403%2C80&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"button-download.png\" width=\"403\" height=\"80\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3138\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/28/fabric-011/button-download/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=1105%2C220&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1105,220\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"button-download\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=800%2C159&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3138 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20403%2080%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"button-download.png\" width=\"403\" height=\"80\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png\"></a></p>\n<p>If you 